&lt;p&gt;Microsoft OS 也是 &lt;a href="https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/1.%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Operating-system/Operating-system/"&gt;Operating system&lt;/a&gt;(操作系统)&lt;/p&gt;
